/* Description: A stack-based delimiter checker. It reads a sequence of
   characters from the user and uses a stack to determine whether the
   delimiters (), [], and {} are correctly matched and nested. It also
   prints a step-by-step trace of every push, peek, and pop, and gives
   a reason when the sequence is invalid.
